<p>Causes a violent earthquake that deals <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">47, 63, 75, 86, 95</acronym> physical damage in a radius of <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 3, 4, 4</acronym> each turn for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 5, 6, 7, 8</acronym> turns, and potentially stuns any and all creatures it affects.</p><p>The damage will increase with your Spellpower.</p>